cloudflared
  Copyright (c) Cloudflare, Inc.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/blob/master/LICENSE

  Yaran does not bundle cloudflared. When a machine is paired with Cloud
  Connect and no `[cloud] cloudflared_path` is set, yaran downloads one pinned,
  checksum-verified cloudflared release from Cloudflare and runs it unmodified.

Cloud Connect and the phone apps
  The control plane and push relay under cloud/, and the phone apps under
  mobile/, depend on third-party npm, Gradle and Swift packages. Each
  yaran-cloud-v* and yaran-mobile-v* release carries a generated inventory of
  those dependencies and their licenses, and the phone app shows the same list
  under About & licenses.
